# Unforgiving Aim, second mode: "Destroy target enchantment." Memnite is no legal target (CR 115.1); Rancor, an Aura on Memnite, is
# destroyed (and returns to its owner's hand by its own trigger, so it ends the scenario in hand, not in the graveyard). Black
# Lotus (three green) pays {G} for Rancor and {2}{G} for the Aim, with Mox Emerald.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Memnite
Rancor
Unforgiving Aim
Forest x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Rancor.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Unforgiving Aim.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Destroy target enchantment)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Rancor)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Forest; Forest; Rancor
Bot1.Graveyard = Unforgiving Aim; Black Lotus
Bot1.Battlefield = Memnite; Mox Emerald
